#. 苗木っち、俺に何の用だべ？
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Did you need something, Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. はっ！　まさか俺を殺そうと！？
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "*Gasp* It better not be my life! Don't kill me!"
msgstr ""

#. 後生だべ！　見逃してくれって！
#. 殺すなら俺じゃなくて他のヤツにしてくれ！！
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Afterlife, protect me! Makoto, kill someone if you\n"
"must, but don't kill meeee!"
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Hiro"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…どうしよう？
#. こんな葉隠クンと一緒に過ごせるか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I spend time with Hiro while he's acting\n"
"like this...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、男２人で熱く語り合うべ。
#. 宇宙発生論についてな。
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Well then, why don't we have a heated discussion about\n"
"cosmogony!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>宇宙発生論について、
#. 葉隠クンの一方的な見解を述べられた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I learned all about Hiro's theories on the origin of\n"
"the universe...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Hiro a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
